Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================
; Disable Windows Copilot
; Windows 11 Gaming Optimization Guide
; Source: FR33THYFR33THY/Ultimate — 6 Windows/9 Copilot.ps1
; Copyright FR33THY (MIT)
; ============================================================
; Tier: Advanced (UI debloat, no functional risk for gaming)
;
; Hides the Copilot taskbar button and disables the Copilot policy
; key at machine + user scope. Mirrors what APPLY-EVERYTHING.ps1
; already does in Phase 11 but exposed as a standalone opt-in tweak
; so users can apply just this without the rest of the customization
; phase.
;
; Pair: revert-copilot.reg
; ============================================================

; --- Disable Copilot button on taskbar (per-user) ---
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Advanced]
"ShowCopilotButton"=dword:00000000

; --- Disable Copilot policy (per-user + machine) ---
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WindowsCopilot]
"TurnOffWindowsCopilot"=dword:00000001

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\WindowsCopilot]
"TurnOffWindowsCopilot"=dword:00000001
